  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Wind energy is a clean and renewable source of energy produced from moving
    air. A wind turbine captures the kinetic energy of the wind and converts it into
    electrical energy.\n\nWhen wind flows across the blades, they begin to rotate.
    The blades are connected to the hub, which transfers this rotational motion to
    the shaft. Inside the nacelle, a gearbox can increase the rotational speed before
    transferring the motion to the generator. The generator then converts mechanical
    energy into electrical energy.\n\nThe electricity travels through cables to a
    transformer, where its voltage is adjusted for efficient transmission to homes,
    schools, industries, and other locations.\n\nEnergy Conversion\n\nWind Energy
    \u2192 Mechanical Energy \u2192 Electrical Energy\n\nWind energy is renewable,
    produces no direct air pollution during operation, and helps reduce dependence
    on fossil fuels."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
